      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Click a source in the sidebar to see only its albums — sources now work as your music directions. Click Albums to see everything again.</li>
          <li>Album notes: choose the writer — Claude or DeepSeek (Settings → General), each with its own API key.</li>
        </ul>
