      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>New design language, part 2 — "instrument": the transport bar got a ruler scale with tick marks and a position needle instead of a slider, and the signal-path readout is now monospaced small caps, like on a measurement device.</li>
          <li>Fixed: the sources list in Settings now scrolls with many folders.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
