      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>New design language, part 1 — "liner notes": the album screen reads like a record sleeve. Dotted leaders in the track list, a monospaced catalog line between hairline rules, italic serif artist, disc sections for multi-disc albums.</li>
          <li>Now Playing speaks the same language.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
